This adapter packages the launch and compact-NVFP4 kernel overlays from
MiaAI-Lab/DeepSeek-v4-Flash-One-DGX-Spark at
fdcd538fbf95fb15b2d6850db9613d22b2c889b8 (MIT), on top of the immutable
0xSero SparkInfer image and its Apache-2.0 dependencies.

Vonk Forge adds only the offline artifact boundary, non-root runtime wrapper,
and immutable catalog metadata. The recipe remains Candidate until a Vonk
physical one-DGX-Spark canary passes.

The creator's image-patch/entrypoint-toolfix.sh (xgrammar >= 0.2.4 at boot, then
transformers 5.13.1) is replaced by a build-time layer that installs the hash-pinned
xgrammar 0.2.4 wheel, because the offline non-root runtime cannot run pip.
